#: ../../functions/func_title.rst:6
msgid "$title"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_title.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$title(text)**"
msgstr "用法：**$title(text)**"

#: ../../functions/func_title.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_title.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 2.1"
msgstr "实现：Picard 2.1"

#: ../../functions/func_title.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_title.rst:14
msgid "Returns ``text`` with the first character in every word capitalized. Note that other characters in the words will not be modified, which allows the preservation of all upper-case acronyms such as \"BBC\". To only have the first character of each word capitalized you could first change the text to lower-case."
msgstr ""
"返回 ``text``，其中每个单词的第一个字符被大写。请注意，单词中的其他字符不会被"
"修改，这允许保留所有大写缩写词，例如 \"BBC\"。要仅将每个单词的第一个字符大写"
"，您可以首先将文本转换为小写。"

